WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.929 --> 00:00:15.855
and Mandy ran down the road and happened to see a domed building.

2
00:00:16.916 --> 00:00:18.217
It had six towers.

3
00:00:19.438 --> 00:00:21.360
The guards were still chasing them.

4
00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:24.282
"Isn't that in the photo?"

5
00:00:24.763 --> 00:00:26.024
Mandy called, pointing.

6
00:00:26.044 --> 00:00:28.105
"Yes!" Vinnie said happily.

7
00:00:29.306 --> 00:00:30.908
The guards were very close.

8
00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.981
But the children weren't worried.

9
00:00:33.001 --> 00:00:36.722
"We're going home," thought Vinnie.

10
00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:39.344
They closed their eyes.

11
00:00:39.864 --> 00:00:41.204
But nothing happened.

12
00:00:41.224 --> 00:00:43.245
"What's wrong?"

13
00:00:43.786 --> 00:00:45.386
cried Mandy, scared.

14
00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:47.587
She looked around.

15
00:00:48.608 --> 00:00:52.049
People were walking toward them carrying small rugs.

16
00:00:52.069 --> 00:00:54.490
"We'd better hide."

17
00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:56.751
"Come with me!"

18
00:00:57.312 --> 00:00:58.052
cried Vinnie.

19
00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:03.370
He grabbed Mandy and joined the crowd walking through a large door.

20
00:01:04.470 --> 00:01:06.611
The guards ran up and looked around.

21
00:01:07.632 --> 00:01:08.552
"Where did they go?"

22
00:01:09.292 --> 00:01:10.213
one guard said.

23
00:01:11.413 --> 00:01:13.894
Vinnie and Mandy walked into a courtyard.

24
00:01:15.355 --> 00:01:17.656
Soon, they met a boy and a girl.

25
00:01:17.676 --> 00:01:19.657
"Where is your mother?"

26
00:01:20.397 --> 00:01:21.097
asked the girl.

27
00:01:22.118 --> 00:01:24.058
She had a scarf covering her head.

28
00:01:24.078 --> 00:01:26.539
"Where is your father?"

29
00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:27.860
asked the boy.

30
00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:31.082
"We're alone," said Vinnie.

31
00:01:31.102 --> 00:01:34.144
"Then come," said the girl.

32
00:01:34.164 --> 00:01:38.487
"My name is Feyza and this is my brother, Nesim."

33
00:01:40.228 --> 00:01:42.590
Mandy and Vinnie introduced themselves.

34
00:01:42.610 --> 00:01:46.592
"Welcome to our mosque," said Feyza.

35
00:01:47.593 --> 00:01:49.775
She smiled and took Mandy's hand.

36
00:01:53.577 --> 00:01:55.599
it's a mosque, not a temple!"

37
00:01:56.379 --> 00:01:59.937
thought Vinnie, as Nesim led him to a different door.

38
00:01:59.957 --> 00:02:04.379
"Women and men pray separately," said Feyza.

39
00:02:05.319 --> 00:02:06.600
"Here is a scarf, Mandy.

40
00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:08.721
Girls must wear them in here."

41
00:02:10.261 --> 00:02:13.022
Mandy put the scarf on as they walked along.

42
00:02:13.042 --> 00:02:16.804
"Take off your shoes," said Feyza.

43
00:02:16.824 --> 00:02:19.505
"Shoes are not permitted in the mosque."

44
00:02:20.465 --> 00:02:22.826
The girls walked barefoot to a fountain.

45
00:02:24.227 --> 00:02:26.428
"Let's wash our feet," she said.

46
00:02:27.568 --> 00:02:30.309
"Muslims always wash before praying to Allah."

47
00:02:30.329 --> 00:02:34.031
"Is Allah the name you use for God?"

48
00:02:34.751 --> 00:02:37.452
asked Mandy, putting her feet in the water.

49
00:02:37.472 --> 00:02:43.134
"Yes. And we pray five times a day," said Feyza.

50
00:02:44.355 --> 00:02:48.036
The girls finished washing and walked upstairs to a balcony.

51
00:02:48.056 --> 00:02:50.017
"Don't be afraid.

52
00:02:50.517 --> 00:02:52.858
Just do what I do," said Feyza.

53
00:02:54.219 --> 00:02:57.180
Meanwhile, Vinnie watched Nesim closely.

54
00:02:58.364 --> 00:02:59.885
They were on the main floor.

55
00:03:01.126 --> 00:03:05.909
Vinnie and Nesim joined the men who were kneeling and bowing side by side.

56
00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:08.531
Then Nesim got up.

57
00:03:08.551 --> 00:03:10.372
"Noon prayers are over!"

58
00:03:10.892 --> 00:03:11.373
he said.

59
00:03:12.754 --> 00:03:14.095
The boys went outside.

60
00:03:14.655 --> 00:03:16.436
Mandy and Feyza were waiting.

61
00:03:16.456 --> 00:03:20.999
"Thank you for showing us your mosque," said Mandy.

62
00:03:21.019 --> 00:03:24.101
"You're welcome," said Feyza.

63
00:03:24.121 --> 00:03:26.123
"We have to go home now.

64
00:03:26.783 --> 00:03:27.964
I'm glad that we met you!"

65
00:03:32.796 --> 00:03:35.958
Mandy and Vinnie were now all alone in the street.

66
00:03:35.978 --> 00:03:39.980
"I felt so safe in there," said Vinnie.

67
00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:44.883
"Well, we're not safe out here," said Mandy.

68
00:03:46.123 --> 00:03:47.604
Vinnie took out the photo.

69
00:03:47.624 --> 00:03:51.226
"Why couldn't we return home?

70
00:03:51.807 --> 00:03:54.548
The building looks the same," said Vinnie.

71
00:03:55.769 --> 00:03:58.290
Mandy looked at the picture and looked up.

72
00:03:59.471 --> 00:04:01.292
This mosque had six towers.

73
00:04:02.673 --> 00:04:04.155
"It's the wrong place!"

74
00:04:04.757 --> 00:04:05.518
Mandy said.

75
00:04:06.821 --> 00:04:09.947
Suddenly a guard appeared and grabbed the children.

76
00:04:09.967 --> 00:04:12.572
"The sultan wants to see you!"

77
00:04:13.093 --> 00:04:13.614
he said.
